{
  "id": "ZEC.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "ZEC",
  "reference": "Zacarías 9",
  "copyright": "Reina-Valera 1909 - Dominio público. Fue realizada por Sociedades Bíblicas Unidas y publicada por primera vez en 1909.",
  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ZEC 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1 Castigo de varios pueblos.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2 Judá será salvo.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "CARGA de la palabra de Jehová contra tierra de Hadrach, y de Damasco su reposo: porque á Jehová están vueltos los ojos de los hombres, y de todas las tribus de Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y también",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamath tendrá término en ella;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiro y",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidón,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "aunque muy sabia sea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bien que Tiro se edificó fortaleza, y amontonó plata como polvo, y oro como lodo de las calles,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He aquí, el Señor la empobrecerá,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "y herirá en la mar su fortaleza, y ella será consumida de fuego.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ascalón verá, y temerá;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaza también, y se dolerá en gran manera: asimismo Ecrón, porque su esperanza será confundida; y de Gaza perecerá el rey, y Ascalón no será habitada.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y habitará en",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Asdod un extranjero, y yo talaré la soberbia de los Palestinos:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y quitaré",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "sus sangres de su boca, y sus abominaciones de sus dientes, y quedarán ellos también para nuestro Dios, y serán como capitanes en Judá, y Ecrón como",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "el Jebuseo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "seré real de ejército á mi casa, á causa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "del que va y del que viene: y no pasará más sobre ellos",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "angustiador; porque ahora miré con mis ojos.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alégrate mucho,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "hija de Sión; da voces de júbilo, hija de Jerusalem:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "he aquí,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "tu rey vendrá á ti, justo y salvador,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "humilde, y cabalgando sobre un asno, así sobre un pollino hijo de asna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y de Ephraim",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "destruiré los carros, y los caballo de Jerusalem; y los arcos de guerra serán quebrados: y hablará",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "paz á las gentes; y su señorío será",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "de mar á mar, y desde el río hasta los fines de la tierra.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y tú también por",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "la sangre de tu pacto serás salva; yo he sacado tus presos del aljibe en que no hay agua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tornaos á la fortaleza, oh",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "presos de esperanza: hoy también os",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "anuncio que os daré doblado.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Porque entesado he para mí á Judá",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "como",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arco, henchí á Ephraim; y despertaré tus hijos, oh Sión, contra tus hijos,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "oh Grecia, y te pondré como espada de valiente.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y Jehová será visto sobre ellos, y su dardo saldrá como relámpago: y",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "el Señor Jehová tocará trompeta, é irá",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "como torbellinos del austro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehová de los ejércitos los amparará, y ellos devorarán, y sujetarán á las piedras de la honda, y beberán y harán estrépido como",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "tomados",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "del vino; y se llenarán como",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "cuenco, ó como los lados del altar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y los salvará",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "en aquel día Jehová su Dios como á rebaño de su pueblo: porque",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "serán engrandecidos en",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "su tierra como piedras de corona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Porque ¡cuánta es su bondad, y cuánta su hermosura! El trigo alegrará á los mancebos, y el vino á las doncellas.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ZEC.10",
    "number": "10",
    "bookId": "ZEC"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "ZEC.8",
    "number": "8",
    "bookId": "ZEC"
  }
}